  "entries": [
    {
      "ordinal": 0,
      "label": "coach_teacher_battle_first_00",
      "hash64": "DD627A8DBA6EFA8F",
      "text": "Tach! Ich bin mal so frei.[VAR 0x0114(0024)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 26,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0024"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 1,
      "label": "coach_teacher_battle_first_01",
      "hash64": "DD62798DBA6EF8DC",
      "text": "Man nennt mich die heißblütige Amura und ich\\nbin hier, um euren Kampfgeist zu entfachen![VAR 0x0114(0024)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 88,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0024"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 2,
      "label": "coach_teacher_battle_sp01_00",
      "hash64": "34032E597B9C9561",
      "text": "Tach, Neuzugang! Hab mich schon gefragt,\\nwer mich herbestellt hat. Du warst das also![VAR 0x0114(0024)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 85,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0024"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 3,
      "label": "coach_teacher_battle_sp01_01",
      "hash64": "34032D597B9C93AE",
      "text": "Eine neue Herausforderung an einem\\nunbekannten Ort... Ich bin hoch motiviert![VAR 0x0114(0024)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 77,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0024"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 4,
      "label": "coach_teacher_battle_sp01_02",
      "hash64": "34032C597B9C91FB",
      "text": "Aber du hast mich bestimmt aus einem\\nbestimmten Grund herbestellt.[VAR 0x0114(0024)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 66,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0024"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 5,
      "label": "coach_teacher_battle_sp01_03",
      "hash64": "34032B597B9C9048",
      "text": "Also raus mit der Sprache, womit kann ich dir\\nhelfen?[VAR 0x0114(0024)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 53,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0024"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 6,
      "label": "coach_teacher_battle_sp01_select_01",
      "hash64": "1C6E62F201B3B63D",
      "text": "Mit Ihrer Heißblütigkeit!",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 7,
      "label": "coach_teacher_battle_sp01_select_02",
      "hash64": "1C6E5FF201B3B124",
      "text": "Mit Ihrem Wissen!",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 8,
      "label": "coach_teacher_battle_sp01_select_03",
      "hash64": "1C6E60F201B3B2D7",
      "text": "Ihre Präsenz allein ist uns allen genug.",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 9,
      "label": "coach_teacher_battle_sp01_04",
      "hash64": "340332597B9C9C2D",
      "text": "Ah ja, das ist mein Spezialgebiet. Bald schon\\nwerd ich die gesamte Blaubeer-Akademie mit\\r\\nmeiner Heißblütigkeit anstecken![VAR 0x0114(0024)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 88,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 124,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0024"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 10,
      "label": "coach_teacher_battle_sp01_04b",
      "hash64": "FE0ADD0D0B1D9A3D",
      "text": "Ach, du hast es auf mein umfangreiches Wissen\\nüber Kämpfe abgesehen, hm?\\c\\nWundert mich nicht. Diese Akademie ist dafür\\nbekannt, bei Pokémon-Kämpfen keine halben\\r\\nSachen zu machen.[VAR 0x0114(0024)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 72,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 162,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 183,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0024"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 11,
      "label": "coach_teacher_battle_sp01_04c",
      "hash64": "FE0ADC0D0B1D988A",
      "text": "Na hör mal, ich bin für gnadenlose Kämpfe\\nhergekommen und nicht, um mir Honig ums\\r\\nMaul schmieren zu lassen![VAR 0x0114(0024)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 81,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 110,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0024"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 12,
      "label": "coach_teacher_battle_sp01_05",
      "hash64": "340331597B9C9A7A",
      "text": "Jedenfalls kannst du alles Weitere mir überlassen.[VAR 0x0114(0024)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 50,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0024"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 13,
      "label": "coach_teacher_battle_sp01_06",
      "hash64": "340330597B9C98C7",
      "text": "Fühl dich einfach, als würdest du auf den starken\\nSchultern eines Hariyama getragen werden.[VAR 0x0114(0024)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 91,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0024"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 14,
      "label": "coach_teacher_battle_sp02_00",
      "hash64": "8D37EC72C2EDB86E",
      "text": "Grüß dich, Neuzugang! Also, diese Tera-Kuppel\\nist ja schon ’ne starke Nummer, oder?[VAR 0x0114(0024)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 83,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0024"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 15,
      "label": "coach_teacher_battle_sp02_01",
      "hash64": "8D37ED72C2EDBA21",
      "text": "Ich hab jetzt erst kapiert, dass sie so was wie der\\nSportplatz der Blaubeer-Akademie ist.[VAR 0x0114(0024)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 89,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0024"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 16,
      "label": "coach_teacher_battle_sp02_02",
      "hash64": "8D37EA72C2EDB508",
      "text": "Bei einem dermaßen gigantischen Sportplatz\\nkann man rennen, wohin und so weit man will!\\r\\nDas ist echt cool.[VAR 0x0114(0024)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 87,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 109,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0024"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 17,
      "label": "coach_teacher_battle_sp02_03",
      "hash64": "8D37EB72C2EDB6BB",
      "text": "Ich hab darüber nachgedacht, als praktische\\nÜbung für die nächste Unterrichtseinheit eine\\r\\nRunde Joggen in der Kuppel einzuplanen.\\c\\nWas hältst du davon?[VAR 0x0114(0024)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 89,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 132,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 156,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0024"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 18,
      "label": "coach_teacher_battle_sp02_select_01",
      "hash64": "37A1D076C23731E0",
      "text": "Tolle Idee!",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 19,
      "label": "coach_teacher_battle_sp02_select_02",
      "hash64": "37A1D376C23736F9",
      "text": "Ist das nicht ein bisschen viel?",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 20,
      "label": "coach_teacher_battle_sp02_04",
      "hash64": "8D37F072C2EDBF3A",
      "text": "Ja, oder? Ein besseres Training für die Beine\\ngibt es kaum.[VAR 0x0114(0024)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 59,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0024"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 21,
      "label": "coach_teacher_battle_sp02_04b",
      "hash64": "E3CCEB0139FC2288",
      "text": "Da hast du vermutlich recht. Mein Problem ist,\\ndass ich vom Joggen einfach nicht genug kriege!\\c\\nNa gut, dann muss eben eine halbe Runde\\nreichen.[VAR 0x0114(0024)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 94,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 146,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0024"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 22,
      "label": "coach_teacher_battle_sp02_05",
      "hash64": "8D37F172C2EDC0ED",
      "text": "Du musst natürlich auch mitmachen![VAR 0x0114(0024)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 34,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0024"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 23,
      "label": "coach_teacher_battle_sp03_00",
      "hash64": "36D2226B2783F7FF",
      "text": "Ich bin echt beeindruckt davon, wie motiviert\\ndie Schüler dieser Akademie sind.[VAR 0x0114(0024)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 79,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0024"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 24,
      "label": "coach_teacher_battle_sp03_01",
      "hash64": "36D2216B2783F64C",
      "text": "Während meines Kampfkurses konnte man ihre\\nKonzentration förmlich spüren![VAR 0x0114(0024)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 73,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0024"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 25,
      "label": "coach_teacher_battle_sp03_02",
      "hash64": "36D2246B2783FB65",
      "text": "Offenbar fallen hier die Noten in den Kursen,\\ndie mit Pokémon-Kämpfen zu tun haben,\\r\\nallgemein mehr ins Gewicht.[VAR 0x0114(0024)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 83,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 114,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0024"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 26,
      "label": "coach_teacher_battle_sp03_03",
      "hash64": "36D2236B2783F9B2",
      "text": "Feine Sache, so was. Wenn sie sich anstrengen,\\nkönnen sie’s locker zu einem Job in einer Liga,\\r\\nals Ranger oder professionelle Trainer schaffen.[VAR 0x0114(0024)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 94,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 146,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0024"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 27,
      "label": "coach_teacher_battle_sp03_select_01",
      "hash64": "C4EEFAC9B85C331B",
      "text": "So viele Möglichkeiten!",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 28,
      "label": "coach_teacher_battle_sp03_select_02",
      "hash64": "C4EEFBC9B85C34CE",
      "text": "Ach, wirklich?",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 29,
      "label": "coach_teacher_battle_sp03_04",
      "hash64": "36D21E6B2783F133",
      "text": "Natürlich könnten sie auch in meine Fußstapfen\\ntreten und Kampfkurs-Lehrer werden![VAR 0x0114(0024)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 82,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0024"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 30,
      "label": "coach_teacher_battle_sp03_04b",
      "hash64": "AAFB011425330CA3",
      "text": "Wie, das wusstest du nicht?\\c\\nDass du es so unwissend zum Champ geschafft\\nhast, spricht für die Hingabe zu deinen Pokémon![VAR 0x0114(0024)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 27,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 123,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0024"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 31,
      "label": "coach_teacher_battle_sp03_05",
      "hash64": "36D21D6B2783EF80",
      "text": "Egal, ob es um Pokémon-Kämpfe oder andere\\nDinge geht... Wer fleißig lernt, dem eröffnen sich\\r\\ngrenzenlose Möglichkeiten.[VAR 0x0114(0024)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 92,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 122,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0024"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 32,
      "label": "coach_teacher_battle_sp03_06",
      "hash64": "36D2206B2783F499",
      "text": "Also vergiss bei all deinen Abenteuern nicht,\\nregelmäßig die Schulbank zu drücken, damit du\\r\\nspäter nichts bereust![VAR 0x0114(0024)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 91,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 117,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0024"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 33,
      "label": "coach_teacher_battle_trade_01_00",
      "hash64": "6BAD646D5CC72559",
      "text": "Aber eigentlich wollte ich dir jetzt keinen\\nVortrag halten.[VAR 0x0114(0024)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 59,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0024"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 34,
      "label": "coach_teacher_battle_trade_01_01",
      "hash64": "6BAD636D5CC723A6",
      "text": "Du weißt, dass ich sowohl als Lehrerin als auch\\nals deine Konkurrentin im Pokémon-Kampf viel\\r\\nvon dir halte.[VAR 0x0114(0024)]",
      "flags": 0,
